</mxCell><mxCell id="b_laporan_kerja" value="&lt;b&gt;Menu: Laporan Pekerjaan (/laporan-pekerjaan)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;[Modul Terpisah - Log Teknis Staf]&lt;/i&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;hr/&gt;Pelaporan kerja teknis harian per divisi:&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Setting:&lt;/b&gt; Desain, layout, keping Plat CTP&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Cetak:&lt;/b&gt; Rekap kerja mesin harian&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;Finishing:&lt;/b&gt; Potong, lipat, lem, jilid&lt;br/&gt;• &lt;b&gt;QC:&lt;/b&gt; Mutu cetak &amp;amp; register warna&lt;br/&gt;&lt;i&gt;*Hak akses divisi diatur di &lt;code&gt;role_laporan_pekerjaan_config&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=9;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;spacingLeft=8;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;spacingBottom=6;align=left;fillColor=#ffedd5;strokeColor=#ea580c;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=8.5;" vertex="1" parent="1">
